{
  "version": 1,
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": "fp-note",
      "widgetType": "markdown",
      "config": {
        "text": "## 📰 The Wikipedia front page, as boxes\n\n**Five boxes, five templates, one widget.** Each card renders a *transclusion* of a Main Page template using Wikipedia's own HTML and its own TemplateStyles — no re-implementation, so a box keeps looking right as editors change it.\n\nPick any template in ⚙ — try `In the news` on `de.wikipedia`, or a project box like `Wikipedia:Community portal`. Two of the Main Page's wrappers (`Picture of the day`, `On this day`) only render on the Main Page, so those cards point at their **dated subpages** with magic words like CURRENTYEAR/CURRENTMONTH — they update themselves.\n\n*Content is CC BY-SA; each card links to the template it came from.*"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fp-itn",
      "widgetType": "wikiBox",
      "config": {
        "box": "In the news",
        "refreshSeconds": 600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fp-tfa",
      "widgetType": "wikiBox",
      "config": {
        "box": "Today's featured article",
        "refreshSeconds": 600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fp-dyk",
      "widgetType": "wikiBox",
      "config": {
        "box": "Did you know",
        "refreshSeconds": 600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fp-otd",
      "widgetType": "wikiBox",
      "config": {
        "box": "Wikipedia:Selected anniversaries/{monthname} {day}",
        "refreshSeconds": 600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fp-potd",
      "widgetType": "wikiBox",
      "config": {
        "box": "POTD/{date}",
        "refreshSeconds": 600
      }
    }
  ],
